#. y4:msg_decision_group=8
#. y4:msg_decision_choices=1. Hmph. Yeah, a little. -> T1.P53 | 2. (I should pretend I know.) -> T1.P62 | 3. Techno...? Never heard of it. -> T1.P66
msgctxt "2520_Ehama"
msgid "Yes! How did you know that!? Do you know a lot about techno?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:msg_type=choice
